      "openalex_id": "W2062205066",
      "doi": "10.1080/14725886.2014.881042",
      "title": "THE RETURN OF THE DEAD SOULS: THE GERMAN STUDENTS' MOVEMENT AND THE GHOSTS OF AUSCHWITZ",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Christoph Schmidt",
